{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uRdCjhInOC1795260692.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港公開羽毛球錦標賽，國家隊的王祉怡晉級女單決賽。</p><p></p><p>紅衫的王祉怡，面對世界第七、日本的宮崎友花，首局領先11-4下，一度被追至2分差距，但她連得4分再拉開，先贏21-15。</p><p></p><p>爭取衛冕的王祉怡，在對上六次交手取得四勝。宮崎友花在第二局領先過11-8，但很快被超前，尾段申請醫療暫停，王祉怡都保著領先，結果贏多局21-15，直落兩局晉級，決賽對泰國的李美妙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.553490+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T17:07:45.964156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:17.236511+00:00","content_hash":"e68da1b16f1d22366b495bc07ff1918350761516bf7461a67f4ee7e76b5f9044","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}